e Coming of Spring, but to the average house-wife, it merely means: It is Time to Clean House. At best, housecleaning is a season of unrest. But its miseries canbe greatly minimized by the wise use of Ivory Soap \u2014 to give newbeauty to furniture; to make rugs and curtains look as they did theday they were bought; to brighten silver and brasswork; to makeblankets as soft and fluffy as when new. Do not hesitate to use Ivory Soap for any purpose for which soap is used\u2014it will improve the appearance of any article which water will not harm. Ivory Soap \u2014 9945^o Per Cent. Pure. , \u25a0\u25a0 ^^ 20</i><br>\n<b>Text Appearing After Image:</b><br>\n<i>A MATTER OF HEALTH</i><br>\n<br>\n<b>Note About Images</b><br>\n</p>\n<i>Please note that these images are extracted from scanned page images that may have been digitally enhanced for readability - coloration and appearance of these illustrations may not perfectly resemble the original work.</i>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1873","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/14773656362/\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/14773656362/</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Source book page: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/stream/stnicholasserial322dodg/stnicholasserial322dodg#page/n134/mode/1up\">https://archive.org/stream/stnicholasserial322dodg/stnicholasserial322dodg#page/n134/mode/1up</a></li></ul>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Dodge, Mary Mapes, 1830-1905","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"At the time of upload, the image license was automatically confirmed using the Flickr <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/API\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:API\">API</a>. For more information see <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:F%C3%A6/Flickr_API_detail\" title=\"User:F\u00e6/Flickr API 